cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mongla, or any measurement out of its ledger, please cite it."
title: "Mongla: an autonomy stack for autonomous underwater vehicles"
abstract: >-
  An independent ROS 2 control, mission and perception stack for autonomous
  underwater vehicles: reflexes on a 500 Hz flight board, thinking on a
  Raspberry Pi 5 with a Hailo-8, and a public measurement ledger that keeps its
  own retractions. Nothing in this stack has been in water.
type: software
license: MIT
